==Other Appearances==
==={{AoC|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
Blue Nightshades are [[Material]]s that can be obtained as a reward for completing [[Challenge]]s and [[Scenario]]s. The [[Warrior]]s can sell them for four [[Rupee]]s. They can also be used to fulfill the requirements for certain [[Quest]]s.
